        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ovilla%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early settlers cleared land to grow wheat, corn, and vegetables, forming the town’s agricultural roots.",
